{"Admin group member pagination miscomputes totalPages using Math.floor(...)+1 and allows offset==user_count, making the UI navigate to a blank last page and mis-disabling next/previous buttons": 0.9318163990974426, "Public group members page only fetches/returns the first 50 members with no pagination controls, making members beyond the first page unreachable": 0.9265886545181274, "Admin::GroupsController#create never assigns alias_level from request params, so new groups are created with the DB default alias_level regardless of the UI selection": 0.8827903270721436, "Admin group member itemView template references 'member' and 'automatic' but the itemView provides no such bindings, so member rendering/removal actions will not work correctly": 0.7718037366867065, "Admin add_members/remove_member persist join-table changes before calling group.save, so the API can return an error while the membership change has already been applied (non-atomic member updates)": 0.6075552105903625, "Admin group edit template is wrapped in a plain <form> without a submit handler and uses default-type <button> elements, which can trigger browser form submission and navigate away from the SPA state": 0.8714832067489624}